2025-06-27 17:37:50,343 | INFO | src.enhanced_multi_source_verifier | [CourtListener] Raw result for '5 U.S. 137': {
  "resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/clusters/84759/",
  "id": 84759,
