      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nMADSEN, J.\n*1159*189\u00b6 1 Pro se petitioner Donna Zink and the Washington Department of Corrections (DOC) seek reversal of a published Court of Appeals decision, which affirmed the trial court's summary judgment ruling in favor of the respondents, John Do",
      "type": "lead-opinion"
    },
    {
